  "historyNote": "#5083, eff 2-26-91; EXPIRED: 2-26-97 New. #6495, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05 New. #12469, INTERIM, eff 1-26-18, EXPIRES: 7-25-18; ss by #12576, eff 7-21-18",
